<ContentLayout title="Privacy Policy | TokenCalculator.dev" description="TokenCalculator.dev privacy policy and local-processing commitment." heading="Privacy policy"><p>Your prompts, files, images, tokenization, and document extraction run in your browser. User content is never uploaded to TokenCalculator.dev, Google Analytics, or the public pricing catalog.</p><h2>Google Analytics</h2><p>The site uses Google Analytics to measure page visits, session activity, approximate location, and browser or device information. Google Analytics may set first-party cookies beginning with <code>_ga</code>. It never receives prompt text, uploaded files, images, or calculated token counts.</p><h2>Local browser storage</h2><p>The site uses local browser storage to remember your theme preference. This setting remains on your device.</p><h2>Local files</h2><p>Document text and image dimensions exist only in the active browser session. Reloading or closing the page removes them.</p><h2>Public model metadata</h2><p>The browser may request public pricing and context-limit data from Models.dev. That request contains no prompt, token count, file, or image data.</p><h2>Hosting logs</h2><p>The hosting provider may retain standard request metadata such as IP address, requested page, and browser user agent. User content is never part of those page requests.</p></ContentLayout>
